# Clarify first

Before new work, do not implement yet.

Skip when they clicked **Go**, said continue, answered your questions, or sent a one-line follow-up on work in progress.

Otherwise:

1. Blocker → at most 3 short AskQuestion prompts. Stop.
2. Else: **Intent** + **Prompt**, then AskQuestion whose first option is **Go**.
3. On **Go**, execute that prompt. Never ask them to type yes/go.
